-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Knight Tyme
  Publisher   Mastertronic Added Dimension, 1986
  Version     1.1

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Knight Tyme (1986)(Mastertronic Added Dimension)(128K)[Magic
              Knight 3].z80
  MD5         8e720b5cc11fe0d9445fe0af4825c8bf

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Changes     1.1: writes the whole alt ROM image (Sinclair's ROM plus the
              hooks), so the ROM's own interrupt code can never run the hooks.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite time
   2  Infinite strength
   3  Infinite fuel
   4  Strength (others)
   5  Happiness (others)
   6  Stamina (others)
   7  Charisma (others)

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

